flowchart TD

T["<b>A TREND WE CAN SOURCE</b>"]
T --> SPLIT{"⑥ WHICH CLOCK?"}

subgraph DAY["🔥 DAILY TRACK — says WHAT IS HAPPENING"]
  DA["<b>06:00</b> · ② listener has run overnight<br/>③ ranked · ④ claims made"]
  DB["<b>07:00</b> · ⑤ verifier — batched<br/><i>one call for the day's probes,<br/>not one per claim</i>"]
  DC["<b>MAX 3 ITEMS A DAY</b><br/><i>Type D derivatives only.<br/>⛔ never originates a new analysis</i>"]
  DD["⑨⑩⑫ draft + lint<br/><i>minutes</i>"]
  DE["<b>⑬ REVIEW — whoever is on duty</b><br/>1–2 min each<br/>⛔ <b>no new notification</b><br/><i>a badge, not a second deadline</i>"]
  DF["⑯a pack → ⑯b <b>a person posts</b><br/><i>next open window, same day</i>"]
  DG["⏱ <b>48h unreviewed → DEMOTES</b><br/><i>joins the weekly queue as an<br/>ordinary derivative.</i><br/><b>NOTHING IS EVER DISCARDED</b>"]
  DA --> DB --> DC --> DD --> DE --> DF
  DE -.->|"nobody got to it"| DG
end

subgraph WK["📅 WEEKLY TRACK — says WHAT IS TRUE"]
  WA["<b>WED</b> · ⑦ TOPIC BOARD<br/>⚠ <b>A HUMAN PICKS</b><br/><i>ranked candidates + evidence.<br/>the machine sorts, never chooses</i>"]
  WB["<b>THU 06:00</b> · ⑧ WORK ORDER<br/><i>calendar slot + picked topic<br/>→ ~40 rows, sized to the<br/>review budget</i>"]
  WC["⑨⑩⑪⑫ assemble · write · chart · lint"]
  WD["<b>THU 07:00 → MON 18:00</b><br/>⑬ REVIEW — 3 people<br/><i>85–115 min between them.<br/><b>two notifications a week, no more</b></i>"]
  WE["<b>TUE–SUN</b> · publishing, spread<br/><i>never dumped in one day</i>"]
  WA --> WB --> WC --> WD --> WE
end

subgraph FAN["THE FAN-OUT — why the volume works"]
  FA["<b>1 PUBLISHED ANALYSIS</b><br/><i>every 3 weeks</i>"]
  FB["<b>→ 16–23 ITEMS</b><br/><i>spread over two weeks</i><br/>LinkedIn ×5 · X thread · carousel<br/>atom + cards · search answers<br/>community drafts · email block"]
  FA --> FB
end

SPLIT -->|"the conversation is<br/>happening TODAY"| DAY
SPLIT -->|"it will still matter<br/>in two weeks"| WK
WE --> FAN
FB -.->|"re-enters at ⑨,<br/>once per derivative"| WC

SAME["⭐ <b>SAME RULES. SAME GATES.<br/>SAME PERSON APPROVING.</b><br/><i>only the clock is different.</i><br/><br/>⛔ the daily track may NEVER run on <b>no_data</b><br/>⛔ it may NEVER commission a new analysis —<br/>an unattended run cannot supply a human's name<br/>✅ a candidate worth commissioning is PROMOTED<br/>to Wednesday's board, not lost"]
DAY -.-> SAME
WK -.-> SAME

WHY["<b>WHY TWO CLOCKS AT ALL</b><br/><i>a rushed analysis is not an analysis,<br/>and a post that lands after the conversation<br/>has moved on is not a post.</i><br/><b>neither track is a compromise</b>"]
SAME -.-> WHY

